index 000000000..48abe23cb
--- /dev/null
+++ b/releasenotes/notes/ovn-metadata-agent-removal-20422685d9dfefe5.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+---
+upgrade:
+  - |
+    The ``neutron-ovn-metadata-agent`` service has been removed, following
+    its removal from Neutron. When ``neutron_plugin_agent`` is ``ovn``,
+    metadata is now served by the ``metadata`` extension of
+    ``neutron-ovn-agent``, which is enabled by default. Upgrading removes
+    the ``neutron_ovn_metadata_agent`` container, its HAProxy child
+    containers and its configuration. Overrides in
+    ``/etc/kolla/config/neutron/neutron_ovn_metadata_agent.ini`` must be
+    moved to ``/etc/kolla/config/neutron/ovn_agent.ini``, and the
+    ``neutron-ovn-metadata-agent`` group can be removed from custom
+    inventories.
